      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After investigating this for a bit, I am fairly confident that the root cause is outside of SDK's logic.\n\nWhile we can reduce the number of AssetDatabase calls that happen in the process, that has a tradeoff of slightly changing the behaviour of program getters, which in turn will affect any external tools that access it.\n\nAll I can really suggest is making sure that your project folder is excluded from Windows Defender, per Rider's (and other tools') recommendation, as there is a high chance that is what's holding the file lock. As well as pausing any other software that might want to hold a temp lock on files (e.g. backup software) and see if the problem persists.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
