  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When creating a new UdonSharp script via \"Create -> U# Script\", sometimes I am presented with a dialog titled \"Moving file failed\" with the text \"Moving <full project path>/Temp/UnityTempFile-<id> to <full project path>/Assets/SerializedUdonPrograms/<id>.asset: Access is denied.\"\n\nThe options are \"Try Again\", \"Force Quit\", and \"Cancel\".\n\nClicking \"Try Again\" always succeeds, so I assume there is some race condition. It only triggers sometimes, but isn't super rare.",
